    "The local argument uses Iwasawa decomposition, commensurability of K and the prescribed Satake eigenvalue law for the arithmetic input vector. The construction here identifies the induced function, its Hecke scalar and the coefficient averages. The subsequent rank reduction supplies convergence of the infinite spherical integral."
